  "display_title": "Office Romance from Hell",
  "description": "Dumped by her boyfriend and fired from her job, Jin-Eon, her family's breadwinner, has no time to cry over the spilled milk. She must find another job and fast. Enter The Hell, a mysterious company with great pay, excellent work-life balance, and an easy commute! What more could she ask for? Or so she thought. Little did she know, she had walked into hell—literally. How will she navigate the harrowing journey in the hellscape of her new job with King Yeomra, her stunning new boss, further complicating everything? Could love blossom in this pit of hell? \n\n(Source: WEBTOON)\n\n*Note: Includes four extra chapters.*",
